@startuml forms-vol09-flow-uz
title Namunaviy yo'l - patologik anatomiya (9-jild)
autonumber

participant "Kasalxona\n(1-jild)" as H
participant "Patologik anatomiya\nbo'limi (9-jild)" as PA
participant "Gistologiya\nlaboratoriyasi" as HIST

alt vafot etgan bemor
  H -> PA : jasad o'limdan keyin yuborildi
  PA -> PA : 223 autopsiya qilingan jasadlar jurnali\n224 autopsiya bayonnomasi\n228 jasadni ro'yxatga olish
  PA -> HIST : 226 gistologiya uchun seksion material
else jarrohlik / biopsiya namunasi
  H -> PA : 225 yo'llanma + biopsiya / operatsion namuna
  PA -> PA : 227 biopsiya va operatsion material jurnali
  PA -> HIST : gistologiya uchun to'qima
end
HIST -> PA : gistologiya natijasi
note over HIST
  To'qima natijalari tahlil hisobotlaridir,
  3-jilddagi klinik laboratoriyalar bilan bir xil andoza.
end note
@enduml
